{
  "_note": "今天(22):星期 + 休/班 · 大号公历日 · 农历 · 节日/节气/明天要上班。数据 day.df。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{hd.y}+({hd.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#C8402F|#F2735F",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):朱砂,每张组件恰好一次。"
      },
      {
        "id": "hd",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-33.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${wdT},--)]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "hdc",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-{hdc.w}-12.0pt",
        "y": "10pt",
        "w": "-1",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${hdT}",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${hd},1),#C8402F|#F2735F,#6B7280|#8E939B)]",
        "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${hd},1),#F8E3DF|#3A1E19,#E7E9EE|#20232A)]",
        "paddingLeft": "5pt",
        "paddingRight": "5pt",
        "paddingTop": "1.5pt",
        "paddingBottom": "1.5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "6pt",
          "leftB": "6pt",
          "rightT": "6pt",
          "rightB": "6pt"
        },
        "hide": "$[if::(or::(eq::(${hd},1),eq::(${hd},2)),0,1)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "big",
        "type": "richText",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "31pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${dnum},--)]",
            "fontSize": "46pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "text": "${@i18n.nbsp}",
            "fontSize": "14pt"
          },
          {
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${monT},)]",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "大号日旁带月份(只有「8」读不出是哪个月,2026-10-08 评审)"
      },
      {
        "id": "ld",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "88pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ldate},--)]",
        "fontSize": "14pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "tg",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "110pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${eveS},1),${eveT},if::(le::(findNotEmpty::(${tagK},9),4),${tag},findNotEmpty::(${lyr},)))]",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${eveS},1),#0E1116|#F3F4F6,if::(eq::(${tagK},3),#128F66|#6FE8BE,if::(le::(findNotEmpty::(${tagK},9),4),#C8402F|#F2735F,#6B7280|#8E939B)))]",
        "_note": "第三行只放一个:明天调休上班的提醒 > 节日 / 节气 > 干支年(设计 §4.6 第 3 条 / §4.2)。eveS = 休 / 班标记打开时的 eveK(英文界面缺省关,doc/overseas-first.md §8)"
      },
      {
        "id": "jn",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "132pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${jqNext},--)] · $[findNotEmpty::(${jqIn},--)]${@i18n.dAfter}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "底行:下一个节气还有几天(day.df 现成键,补下半留白)"
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "dAfter": " 天后",
        "nbsp": " "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "dAfter": "d",
        "nbsp": " "
      }
    }
  }
}
